    "Replaces the 4 Micro Kart soundtrack tracks (@yolo-arcade/game-micro-kart@1.5.1) with crisp, note-accurate 16-bit classic-arcade remixes of 8 universally recognizable pre-1925 public-domain melodies: Beethoven's 5th & Ride of the Valkyries, Trepak & Carmen Overture, Eine Kleine Nachtmusik & Barber of Seville, and Toccata in D Minor & Badinerie."
